# Normalize every text file to LF in the working tree on all platforms. corpus-lint's
# frozen-path check and index-gen --check compare bytes exactly; a CRLF checkout on Windows
# would make an untouched entry read as modified and a fresh render differ from disk. Pinning
# LF keeps those byte-level gates honest cross-platform (blindspot class: platform-assumption).
* text=auto eol=lf
